{"part": {"video_part_id": 669, "bvid": "BV1uA41197j3", "page_index": 0, "cid": 920734852, "title": "【作词翻唱】疏狂", "duration_ms": 157000, "processing_status": "metadata_collected", "created_at": 1792025947, "updated_at": 1792025947}, "transcript": {"transcript_id": 1151, "video_part_id": 669, "source_kind": "asr-local", "language": "Chinese", "model_id": 1, "version": 1, "content_sha256": "d01783ce55ccdf2a11ff693c070a70e8389b7d0b1879794bec63c9c4a9ced97f", "created_at": 1792059352}, "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start_ms": 400, "end_ms": 4640, "text": "这个是一六年写的一首老词啊，"}, {"ordinal": 1, "start_ms": 5760, "end_ms": 7120, "text": "用的这个曲子呢是什么？"}, {"ordinal": 2, "start_ms": 7120, "end_ms": 9280, "text": "火云邪神的这个里面的啊。"}, {"ordinal": 3, "start_ms": 20320, "end_ms": 23360, "text": "几番风染层林如"}, {"ordinal": 4, "start_ms": 25840, "end_ms": 28560, "text": "霜，化作离人泪。"}, {"ordinal": 5, "start_ms": 31120, "end_ms": 42240, "text": "谁诉漂泊烟雨残声？天寒秋冷。"}, {"ordinal": 6, "start_ms": 42240, "end_ms": 50240, "text": "悠悠云回月落何方？不曾入梦中。"}, {"ordinal": 7, "start_ms": 53040, "end_ms": 59920, "text": "已是锦里鬓角摘星，浊酒初停。"}, {"ordinal": 8, "start_ms": 64240, "end_ms": 69200, "text": "笑只笑当年又惨淡多情，"}, {"ordinal": 9, "start_ms": 70480, "end_ms": 73040, "text": "春雨不雨如断如续。"}, {"ordinal": 10, "start_ms": 75280, "end_ms": 79040, "text": "怨只怨他乡多忘却忧伤，"}, {"ordinal": 11, "start_ms": 80880, "end_ms": 84640, "text": "归时佳人望故疏狂。"}, {"ordinal": 12, "start_ms": 86960, "end_ms": 93360, "text": "谁说赠与他人的心，换得来真意？"}, {"ordinal": 13, "start_ms": 97040, "end_ms": 104240, "text": "谁说种在心中的梦，不容质疑？"}, {"ordinal": 14, "start_ms": 108000, "end_ms": 115440, "text": "谁说梦里清晰的你，看透了往昔？"}, {"ordinal": 15, "start_ms": 118880, "end_ms": 126240, "text": "谁说告别了你如今，是我自己？"}, {"ordinal": 16, "start_ms": 130240, "end_ms": 133920, "text": "不必问少年有几多痴情，"}, {"ordinal": 17, "start_ms": 136400, "end_ms": 138880, "text": "春雨似雨如影随形。"}, {"ordinal": 18, "start_ms": 140480, "end_ms": 144800, "text": "不必问他乡是谁在忧伤？"}, {"ordinal": 19, "start_ms": 146880, "end_ms": 150720, "text": "谁说佳人望故疏狂？"}, {"ordinal": 20, "start_ms": 151520, "end_ms": 156000, "text": "抢拍了，你们自己调整的唱啊，最后最后那个不必问抢拍，你们自己调整一下。"}]}